    - target: {fileID: 7762377230361289728, guid: 0c85985582b705345b9767ea80befaa6,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '- When in smooth locomotion, run by holding down the left thumbstick.

        -
        In simulated mode you can sleep in your house to skip till the next day.

        -
        You can save inside your house near your bed.

        - Some items are stackable.
        You can grab a single item from a stack by holding down the trigger button
        while grabbing.

        - Apples, Coconuts, ores, trash, etc will respawn
        every day.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
